; The Native4D instance of [Loop_ir.Loop_dialect], so a Native4D graph reaches
; the Loop bundle builders (C, Wasm, JavaScript, and the SSA kernels through
; the bundle's placed plans).
;
; A library of its own because [loop_ir] depends on [native], never on a
; further dialect: its JavaScript mirror would otherwise need [native4d_js].
; Everything downstream of the dialect record names no operation type, so this
; is the only place the two meet. See the Native4D design record in .ai/.

(library
 (name loop_native4d)
 (libraries err_trace loop_ir native native4d))
